This package repackages dsh-archived-sessions by Zephyr-vibe, used under the
MIT License. The original project lives at:

    https://github.com/Zephyr-vibe/dsh-archived-sessions

Upstream publishes this plugin prebuilt, with no sources, so vendor/ holds its
published lib/ output verbatim and scripts/build.mjs adapts it. Nothing in its
behaviour is modified; the two adaptations are packaging concerns:

  - `schemastery` is inlined into the host half. Upstream imports it as a
    runtime dependency that its own installer npm-installs into the profile.
    This repository's installer only copies files, and the harness profile does
    not provide schemastery, so an as-is copy fails to load with
    ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND.

  - The browser bundle's `__ModuleLoader__` id is rewritten from
    "dsh-archived-sessions" to "@dsh-pro/archived-sessions", because the web boot
    manifest looks a bundle up by the installed package name.

